                // (48,9): warning CS8627: The type 'SOut1' cannot be used as type parameter 'T' in the generic type or method 'B.FOut2<T>()'. Nullability of type argument 'SOut1' doesn't match constraint type 'IOut<object>'.
                //         FOut2<SOut1>(); // 4
